    "description" : "Detects when code catches the general Exception class, which is often too broad or general.",
    "explanation" : "Checks for catching a `Exception`. In most cases that is too broad or\ngeneral. It should usually be restricted to framework or infrastructure\ncode, rather than application code.",
    "enabled" : true,
    "timeToFix" : 10,
    "parameters" : [
