    "description" : "Detects and flags switch statements that contain no case blocks or code, which are confusing and serve no purpose.",
    "explanation" : "Checks for empty *switch* statements. Empty *switch* statements are\nconfusing and serve no purpose.\n\nHere is an example of code that produces a violation:\n\n        def myMethod() {\n            switch(myVariable) {\n                // empty\n            }\n        }",
    "enabled" : true,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
